WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.384
Lab 2 runs Runbook R ten's reads on one

2
00:00:02.384 --> 00:00:05.200
test instance and its
host, never production.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.100
It was not run by the authors.

4
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.775
Every step reads: nothing is
issued, bound, changed or restarted.

5
00:00:11.775 --> 00:00:15.079
Sign in as a test reader whose
login holds the view-state and

6
00:00:15.079 --> 00:00:18.450
view-definition permissions
the page lists, never sysadmin.

7
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.925
Read the configured T L S
thumbprint, the host's certificates,

8
00:00:21.925 --> 00:00:24.775
the certificate-mapped
logins and the endpoints.

9
00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:28.500
An empty thumbprint means sequel
server picked a certificate itself.

10
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.925
Save the reads by hand in the fixture's
shape, and run the dependency list on them.

11
00:00:32.925 --> 00:00:34.527
Then delete the lab folder,

12
00:00:34.527 --> 00:00:38.330
or keep the saved reads inside
your boundary as R ten's evidence.
